      <h1 id="art-h1">How Much Does Inbound Marketing Cost?</h1>
      <p class="citation">Inbound marketing costs about $5,000 to $20,000 a month for a full-service US agency, according to Protocol 80, and about £4,500 to £6,500 a month for a basic UK package, according to Axon Garside. Cost depends on channels, content volume and who does the work.</p>
      <div class="meta-badges"><span class="badge">📅 {published}</span><span class="badge">✓ {readTime}</span></div>
