    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="article-layout">
      <article class="article-body prose">

        <div class="definition-box" style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
          <div class="definition-box__label">Key Takeaways</div>
          <ul style="margin: var(--space-2) 0 0 var(--space-5); color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.8;">
            <li>A full-service US inbound agency retainer runs $5,000–$20,000 a month (Protocol 80); a basic UK package runs £4,500–£6,500 (Axon Garside, 2025).</li>
            <li>Content production is the biggest line at about $5,000 a month, followed by multimedia at about $3,000.</li>
            <li>HubSpot Marketing Hub Professional starts at $800 a month with a $3,000 onboarding fee; Enterprise starts at $3,600 with $7,000.</li>
